{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14218130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14218130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421813001:1":{"text":"급속 성장 포션을 사용한 뒤에 거대 버섯이 시들어버렸어!","source_cn":"使用了速生魔药后，巨蕈竟然枯萎了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335FBF858A9FF414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421813002:1":{"text":"그리고 버섯 정령들이 갑자기 튀어나와 우리를 공격하잖아. 이게 어떻게 된 일이지...","source_cn":"还有那些突然冒出来攻击我们的菇灵，这究竟是怎么回事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D5199BEB89D8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421813003:1":{"text":"당신들이 이곳 생태계를 파괴했잖아요! 그들의 보금자리를 파괴한 거라고요!","source_cn":"因为你们破坏了这里的生态！破坏了它们的家园！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8914982AEC2A7456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421813004:1":{"text":"당신들은... 지상 사람들이군요... 무슨 목적으로 여길 왔죠? 흑... 나를 해치지 마세요...","source_cn":"你们是……地表的人……你们有什么目的？呜……不要伤害我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4224EE7F071DB7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421813005:1":{"text":"미안해, 난 어떤 생물도 해칠 생각이 없어. 그냥 더 빨리 자라게 하고 싶었을 뿐이야!","source_cn":"抱歉，我没有想伤害任何生物，我只想让它长得更快些！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1854433236AA4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421813006:1":{"text":"흑... 내가 심은 꽃도 시들었어요... 이 주변을 좀 보세요...","source_cn":"呜……我种的花也枯萎了……看看这周围……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x838C77B6DC575F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的少女":{"text":"겁먹은 소녀","source":"胆怯的少女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}